Printing a document

The `Editor` sends a print job to the `Print spooler`, with the label `job`.
The `Print spooler` passes it to the `Printer`, also with the label `job`. The
`Printer` reports back to the `Print spooler`, with the label `status`.
---
Editor -> Print spooler: job
Print spooler -> Printer: job
Printer -> Print spooler: status
